seccomp.json in this directory is derived from profiles/seccomp/default.json
of the Moby project, release v28.0.0 (https://github.com/moby/moby),
Copyright 2012-2017 Docker, Inc., licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in seccomp.LICENSE.

Changes from the original:

- Every rule that applied only to a container holding a capability
  (an "includes.caps" condition) is removed.
- The rules that applied only to a container without CAP_SYS_ADMIN, the
  flag-masked "clone" allowance and the ENOSYS answer to "clone3", apply
  unconditionally.

No syscall is allowed that the original does not allow a container with
no capabilities.
